    - rid: 9079474908378955920
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, Natsuki, did you forget the part where there was one of him, and
      five of us?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That generally makes fights easier. Strength in numbers, and all that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, but the spider was harder-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955921
